    "classification": "rapier_adapter_failed_to_route_empty_qualified_support_as_explicit_v3_observation_unavailable",
    "confirmed_source_facts": [
      "The Rapier C1 composition constructed every ScheduledLoadTransferRequestV3 with observation_available=true and observation_unavailable_reason=None.",
      "The portable v3 contract requires observation_available=false plus a nonempty reason when the host has no usable stability observation; NO_QUALIFIED_SUPPORT_CONTACT is the existing declared reason.",
      "The Godot/Jolt adapter already declares observation_available=false when its qualified support-point map is empty.",
      "The C1 synthetic support pattern never produced zero qualified contacts, so its partial-support and fail-zero coverage did not exercise this host route.",
      "On a C1 composition error, the physical loop stepped zero motor targets instead of applying the valid BW15F-B base command with an exact-zero stability contribution."
    ],
